        "slc_1e16c2ab009061fe35103dd066397a1329ad9c06cad80b7976fe9423467961aa"
      ],
      "text": "little-coder is built on pi as a plain dependency, adding roughly 30 extensions, 30 skill markdown files, and a Python benchmark harness under .pi/extensions/, skills/, and benchmarks/."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fe7a4ac89485c78a31919f0da9600f40d78c2026c0dd63664e0a09de80a16014",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
