          "git_sha": "94e2bc641c64a25eb1c389dc4985a50dc5e2277e",
          "line_end": 16,
          "line_start": 16,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "itayinbarr/little-coder",
          "url": "https://github.com/itayinbarr/little-coder/blob/a9e467f2be43b78441d723c84f173b98771b51ef/README.md#L16-L16"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9a498e738178c1ed33ff8c5e04d02cd72dec4910feb2ea5d559e2a72d89cabfc"
      ],
      "text": "The launcher runs pi with --no-extensions and wires in only the bundled set, keeping cold-start context near 7k tokens and making loaded behavior fixed at ship time."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9d30a390208c87bd250b0333f8b31fa608e9950bc43de6c550de6fd49190c835",
