      ],
      "text": "The CLI accepts --model (e.g. llamacpp/qwen3.6-35b-a3b, anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5, ollama/qwen3.5, lmstudio/local-model) and --list-models; bare invocation launches the models.json default."
    },
