        "slc_e87501de43e01ebea2607cd6cfbf1ac95ca8b8e2ea2262bf19904f6605fd3825"
      ],
      "text": "Shell calls are gated against a built-in safe-prefix whitelist before pi's confirmation flow; rm and sudo are excluded, and LITTLE_CODER_BASH_ALLOW adds prefixes per deployment."
    },
