        "slc_f4bb5d1ed14669e8eecb8fda6516ef2a96a1266b9dbf81a262ef6ff4d504651d"
      ],
      "text": "Per-phase model selection lets planning and implementation use different models via /plan-model, /action-model, and /model-handover auto|manual, with handover deferred until implementation begins."
    },
