      ],
      "text": "Published results include Aider Polyglot 45.56% (Qwen3.5-9B) and 78.67% (Qwen3.6-35B-A3B), Terminal-Bench-Core 40.0%, Terminal-Bench 2.0 leaderboard 24.6%±3.2, and GAIA validation 40.00%, all on an 8 GB VRAM laptop with no cloud inference."
    },
